// microbench point7: 7 properties of a known person (NS1, the vid is given).
// Reads: the Person document by _key (the 7 PERSON_PROPS); no traversal, no index.
// Evaluator: queries/point.py _point(nprops=7) -- read_vertex_props on the anchor, 1 row.
// mb2 lineage: MB1-2 (MB2 used a FOR+FILTER on _key; DOCUMENT() is the direct key read).
LET p = DOCUMENT(CONCAT("Person/", @personId))
RETURN {firstName: p.firstName, lastName: p.lastName, gender: p.gender, birthday: p.birthday,
    creationDate: p.creationDate, locationIP: p.locationIP, browserUsed: p.browserUsed}
